  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Without Violence: For Women&#x2019;s Equality and Safety</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to prevent and respond to gender-based violence (GBV) in four rural areas of Mali by empowering women and engaging men and religious leaders. Led by Mission Fraternelle Lutherienne au Mali (MFLM) , the initiative builds on established women&#x2019;s associations to enhance awareness, provide psycho-social and legal support, and promote financial independence. Activities include community education, vigilance committees, male engagement sessions, and faith-based advocacy. The project also strengthens MFLM&#x2019;s organizational capacity and safeguarding mechanisms, aiming for sustainable change in attitudes, improved protection systems, and greater gender equality in local communities.</narrative>
  </description>
